services+=cards([('Starting with a new part','Share a drawing, model or physical sample, its intended application and an expected quantity. We can discuss design improvements and the scope of mould development.'),('Bringing an existing mould','Share the tool details, condition and production requirement. Mould suitability, repairs or modifications can be discussed before the production plan is agreed.'),('Finishing the full requirement','Tell us about assembly, finishing, colour, packing or other downstream needs at the start, so the complete scope can be considered together.')],'Choose the starting point that fits your project.','PROJECT PATHWAYS')
