materials+=cards([('General-purpose polymers','PP, PPCP, HDPE, LDPE, LLDPE, PS and PVC are among the materials we process. Grade selection depends on the application and production requirements.'),('Engineering plastics','ABS, polycarbonate, Nylon, POM / Delrin and PMMA provide additional options for components with specific functional or appearance requirements.'),('Elastomers','TPR, TPE and TPU are part of our processing capabilities. Share the flexibility, feel and service environment your part requires.')],'A broad material toolkit.','MATERIAL FAMILIES')
